  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🚀 VERSION 0.2.0 - BREAKING CHANGES:\n        \n- REMOVED: SuperfilterBuilder.For<T>() approach (breaking change)\n- NEW: Unified IQueryable extension approach with .WithSuperfilter()\n- SIMPLIFIED: Single fluent API - no more dual approaches\n- IMPROVED: Natural integration with existing LINQ workflows\n- UPDATED: Complete documentation and examples\n- ENHANCED: Better IntelliSense and type safety\n        \nMigration: Replace SuperfilterBuilder.For<T>().Build(query) with query.WithSuperfilter().WithFilters()\n        \nThis is a breaking change - please update your code accordingly.",
